OL,3,AEl Salvador's president threatens
OL,4,AHaitian gangs over military hostages
OL,5,
OL,6,FEl Salvador's president has said he has
OL,7,Flaunched a military operation to rescue
OL,8,Ffour air force personnel who have been
OL,9,Fmissing in Haiti since Sunday.
OL,11,FNayib Bukele wrote in a post on X that
OL,12,FWednesday's attack was "nothing"
OL,13,Fcompared with what would happen if all
OL,14,Fthe hostages - who he said were not
OL,15,Fcombatants - were not returned alive.
OL,17,FThey went missing after being ambushed
OL,18,Fby "heavily armed criminal groups," El
OL,19,FSalvador's armed forces said. The
OL,20,Fambush occurred in Croix-des-Bouquets,
OL,21,Fan area controlled by armed groups.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
